    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Space Station Bar</h2>My Space Bar is a restaurant and attractions simulator where you build and manage a space station bar!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a08cc1dc420a1a09524f9ab5517fe6d4.poster.avif?t=1754628285\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a08cc1dc420a1a09524f9ab5517fe6d4.webm?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a08cc1dc420a1a09524f9ab5517fe6d4.mp4?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Expand your station. Build a dining area with tables, lights, and d\u00e9cor. Build a kitchen and hire staff. Make your space bar even more special by adding dance clubs, arcades, and more. The happier your customers are, the more <i>space bucks</i> they will spend!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Station</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/7aea0f8e23a4e384180607c6ee7e5642.poster.avif?t=1754628285\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/7aea0f8e23a4e384180607c6ee7e5642.webm?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/7aea0f8e23a4e384180607c6ee7e5642.mp4?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Customize your space station using different kinds of floors and walls. Will you go with a space age look, or perhaps something more cozy? It\u2019s up to you! How you build your station matters. Tables near windows and good lighting are more appealing than those near a noisy generator. The better ambiance you provide the more money you will make!<br><br>Build solar panels and generators to provide power for all of the cool things in your station. Dance clubs and arcades require quite a bit of power. You\u2019ll need to decide the best places to put the generators to avoid disturbing your patrons.<br><br>Customers will want a comfortable and well-lit place to eat. Make sure your tables are near light sources, fans to circulate fresh air, d\u00e9cor to beautify the area, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire and Train Your Staff</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a504fc7a60d3bc074d15a7fe8fddc4cc.poster.avif?t=1754628285\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a504fc7a60d3bc074d15a7fe8fddc4cc.webm?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a504fc7a60d3bc074d15a7fe8fddc4cc.mp4?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hire and level up staff to run the kitchen, serve the food, play music, and maintain your equipment. Each staff member has different strengths and weaknesses. A good waiter can increase the chance that a party will order dessert and a good mechanic will ensure that all of your arcade machines are in working order. And of course, doing that well means more money!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Recipes</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/2696c719d4fa8ea786e3441be676d0a7.poster.avif?t=1754628285\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/2696c719d4fa8ea786e3441be676d0a7.webm?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/2696c719d4fa8ea786e3441be676d0a7.mp4?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Start with a simple menu and then expand into more choices including dessert and specialty drinks. The more options you have, the more satisfied your customers will be.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Specialty Areas</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/12f8850c84cf9abe0c44fdf39cf3c435.poster.avif?t=1754628285\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/12f8850c84cf9abe0c44fdf39cf3c435.webm?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/12f8850c84cf9abe0c44fdf39cf3c435.mp4?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unlock and build a dance club and an arcade! The more atmosphere you add to the dance club and the more arcade machines you provide the more your customers will spend time there and of course, spend money too. Additional specialty areas will be added during development as well!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/c3baac7caaea8fd4b58ca5b179efdaae.poster.avif?t=1754628285\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/c3baac7caaea8fd4b58ca5b179efdaae.webm?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/c3baac7caaea8fd4b58ca5b179efdaae.mp4?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Space Station Bar</h2>My Space Bar is a restaurant and attractions simulator where you build and manage a space station bar!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a08cc1dc420a1a09524f9ab5517fe6d4.poster.avif?t=1754628285\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a08cc1dc420a1a09524f9ab5517fe6d4.webm?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a08cc1dc420a1a09524f9ab5517fe6d4.mp4?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Expand your station. Build a dining area with tables, lights, and d\u00e9cor. Build a kitchen and hire staff. Make your space bar even more special by adding dance clubs, arcades, and more. The happier your customers are, the more <i>space bucks</i> they will spend!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Station</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/7aea0f8e23a4e384180607c6ee7e5642.poster.avif?t=1754628285\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/7aea0f8e23a4e384180607c6ee7e5642.webm?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/7aea0f8e23a4e384180607c6ee7e5642.mp4?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Customize your space station using different kinds of floors and walls. Will you go with a space age look, or perhaps something more cozy? It\u2019s up to you! How you build your station matters. Tables near windows and good lighting are more appealing than those near a noisy generator. The better ambiance you provide the more money you will make!<br><br>Build solar panels and generators to provide power for all of the cool things in your station. Dance clubs and arcades require quite a bit of power. You\u2019ll need to decide the best places to put the generators to avoid disturbing your patrons.<br><br>Customers will want a comfortable and well-lit place to eat. Make sure your tables are near light sources, fans to circulate fresh air, d\u00e9cor to beautify the area, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire and Train Your Staff</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a504fc7a60d3bc074d15a7fe8fddc4cc.poster.avif?t=1754628285\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a504fc7a60d3bc074d15a7fe8fddc4cc.webm?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/a504fc7a60d3bc074d15a7fe8fddc4cc.mp4?t=1754628285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hire and level up staff to run the kitchen, serve the food, play music, and maintain your equipment. Each staff member has different strengths and weaknesses. A good waiter can increase the chance that a party will order dessert and a good mechanic will ensure that all of your arcade machines are in working order. And of course, doing that well means more money!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Recipes</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/2696c719d4fa8ea786e3441be676d0a7.poster.avif?t=1754628285\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880860/extras/2696c719d4fa8ea786e3441be